1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
LADY IN GOLD GOWN: Long enough to know he was never going to marry you.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,200
LADY JULIANA: Father...

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,600
LADY JULIANA: Tell them this is a mistake.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,900
LADY JULIANA: Father... please look at me.

5
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:16,900
MATRIARCH: Enough!

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:20,500
MATRIARCH: You have embarrassed this family long enough.

7
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,200
LADY JULIANA: Embarrassed you?

8
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,500
MATRIARCH: Clarissa knows how to carry herself.

9
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:30,000
MATRIARCH: She has beauty, connections, and a future worth protecting.

10
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,300
LADY JULIANA: And I am what?

11
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,800
LADY IN GOLD GOWN: You are the daughter people tolerate because they have to.
